      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl lg:text-2xl text-cool-gray-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Choose from 12 strategically located data centers across 3 continents for the best performance and lowest ping.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Global Stats -->
    <div class="mb-20 grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 border-2 border-[#FF9C20] rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
